  RegressionTreeGUI --|> JFrame
  RegressionTreeCanvas --|> JPanel
  DatabaseTreeClient ..|> Closeable

  RegressionTreeGUI "1" *-- "1" RegressionTreeCanvas : treeCanvas
  RegressionTreeGUI ..> DatabaseTreeClient : apre sessione
  RegressionTreeGUI ..> DatabaseTreeResult : legge risultato
  RegressionTreeGUI ..> Data : training locale
  RegressionTreeGUI ..> RegressionTree : apprende in locale
  RegressionTreeGUI ..> VisualTree : converte e mostra

  RegressionTreeCanvas --> "0..1" VisualTree : tree (transient)
  RegressionTreeCanvas ..> VisualNode : dispone e disegna
  RegressionTreeCanvas ..> RegressionTreeGUI : colori condivisi
  VisualTree "0..1" *-- "1" VisualNode : root
  VisualNode "0..1" *-- "0..*" VisualNode : children
  VisualTree ..> RegressionTree : from
  VisualTree ..> RegressionTreeAccess : crea adattatore
  RegressionTreeAccess ..> RegressionTree : legge root e childTree
  RegressionTreeAccess ..> Node : restituisce radice

  DatabaseTreeClient ..> DatabaseTreeSnapshot : inspect
  DatabaseTreeClient ..> DatabaseTreeResult : crea e restituisce
  DatabaseTreeClient ..> VisualNode : buildNode
  DatabaseTreeClient ..> VisualTree : crea
  DatabaseTreeResult --> "1" VisualTree : tree

  note for RegressionTreeGUI "Solo RegressionTreeGUI è pubblica.<br/>Le altre sette classi GUI sono package-private."
  note for RegressionTreeAccess "Accesso riflessivo in sola lettura alla base locale.<br/>childrenOf restituisce una copia dell’array."
  note for DatabaseTreeClient "Protocollo TCP del server MAP: comandi 0, 1, 3.<br/>Ricostruisce l’albero tramite predizioni; nessun JDBC."
